<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Marshall EPS view raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Marshall EPS view raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>--EVEREN Securities Inc said Tuesday it raised its 1998 earnings-per-share estimate on Marshall &amp; Isley Corp to $2.75 from $2.65, citing the company's agreement to acquire Security Capital Corp.</p>
<p>--Its 1997 EPS estimate of $2.35 remains unchanged.</p>
<p>--EVEREN also raised its six-month price target on the company's stock to $45 from $39 and, 18-month target to $50 from $45.</p>
<p>--Marshall &amp; Ilsley, a bank holding company, was up 5/8 at 38.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
